@host = http://localhost:5224

### Weather (rutas anteriores)
GET {{host}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### ======== Permisos basados en roles (ver PERMISSION-BASED-AUTHORIZATION.md) ========

### Login como Admin: tiene todos los permisos de Products
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Login como Manager: solo View y Create
# @name managerLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@example.com",
  "password": "Manager123!"
}

### Login como User: solo View
# @name userLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User123!"
}

### Borrar sin token -> 401 (no hay identidad)
DELETE {{host}}/Products/1

### User borra -> 403 (autenticado, pero sin Products.Delete)
DELETE {{host}}/Products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Admin borra -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/Products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Manager crea un producto -> 201
POST {{host}}/Products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Standing Desk",
  "price": 429.00
}

### Que puede hacer hoy el rol Manager?
GET {{host}}/admin/roles/Manager/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Revocar Create a Manager: sin redespliegue ni reinicio
DELETE {{host}}/admin/roles/Manager/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "permission": "Permissions.Products.Create"
}

### Manager crea otra vez con el MISMO token -> 403 de inmediato
# Con Permissions:Source = Lookup se deniega en la siguiente peticion.
# Cambia appsettings.json a "Token" y esto sigue dando 201 hasta que el token expire.
POST {{host}}/Products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Desk Lamp",
  "price": 59.00
}

### Concederlo de nuevo
POST {{host}}/admin/roles/Manager/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "permission": "Permissions.Products.Create"
}

### ======== Segundo modulo: Orders (ver seccion 10 de la guia) ========

### Manager lista pedidos -> 200 (tiene Orders.View)
GET {{host}}/Orders
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### User lista pedidos -> 403 (solo tiene Products.View: cada modulo se concede por separado)
GET {{host}}/Orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Manager borra un pedido -> 403 (no tiene Orders.Delete)
DELETE {{host}}/Orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Conceder Orders.Delete a Manager -> el endpoint reconoce el modulo nuevo
POST {{host}}/admin/roles/Manager/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "permission": "Permissions.Orders.Delete"
}

### Cuanto cuesta poner permisos dentro del token?
GET {{host}}/Diagnostics/token-size

### Medir un numero concreto de permisos
GET {{host}}/Diagnostics/token-size?permissions=120

### Como son los claims de quien llama (util cuando se deniega en silencio)
GET {{host}}/Diagnostics/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
